				(6) An appeal under sub-section (2) shall be disposed of within sixty days from the date of filing. 79B. Consequence of failure to pay penalty.— (1) Where any person fails to pay the penalty imposed under section 79A within such period as may be prescribed, such failure shall constitute an offence and such person shall be punishable in accordance with the provisions of this section.
			TC
